#: desc: Pattern rules, several targets per line and targets given by variables
-v COLOR=0 test/fixtures/Makefile.targets-forms
#: stdout
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------
%.tab.c %.tab.h      A pattern rule
%.c                  Another pattern rule
bin/%.o              A pattern rule with a prerequisite
first second third   Three targets on one line (separated by several spaces)
t1                   Target with spaces before and after
$(TARGET-NAME)       Target from a variable in `$()`
${TARGET-NAME}       Target from a variable in `${}`
$T                   Target from a one-letter variable
$(t1) ${t2} t3       Variables and a name (issue #12)
-----------------------
